  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In games with custom sprays and similar, they are often used more for trolling that for self expression. I do not want this added as a new way to intentionally upset other players, when this is already a common issue in VRChat. Currently nuisance users at least have to at least be near me to cause trouble, now this will add a way for them to cause trouble from the moment I enter an instance even if they are no where near me.\n\nI also generally dislike the idea of the worlds creators put so much work into making being covered up but unrelated textures. I understand you are adding a feature to target and block them, but that also adds more things in a world that will suddenly activate the laser pointer breaking immersion. I understand you are giving world creators the ability to disable them in their world settings, but most worlds will use the default setting of them on.\n\nI can only see bad things coming from this and I don't see what this feature adds much beyond the custom emotes. Every advantage it has over emotes are features that can be heavily abused for trolling. Please reconsider this feature. If not, please at least consider a user level setting to hide all players Stickers and/or all Stickers from non-friends.",
